{"title": "Pixel 11 Pro’s HiLight feature also now works on WhatsApp messages", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/13/pixel-11-pro-hilight-whatsapp/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/08/Pixel-11-Pro-Hilight-Phone-Call.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After being barebones at launch, Google is improving on Pixel 11 Pro’s Hilight feature with message support, now including WhatsApp.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/13/pixel-11-pro-hilight-whatsapp/#more-737533\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-13T16:15:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-14T16:30:38.251314+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Pixelated 125: Google’s glasses, Meta’s baggage", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/13/pixelated-125-googles-glasses-metas-baggage/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2024/03/Pixelated-cover.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Welcome to Pixelated episode 125. This week, <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/12/google-glasses-hands-on/\">Abner has tried out</a> Google’s new lineup of “Intelligent Eyewear,” and he’s got plenty to share with Damien and Will. Can Google nail the smart glasses experience while <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/12/google-android-xr-glasses-camera-privacy/\">digging itself out of a privacy hole</a> Meta first dug? For as much work as the company’s doing, only time might tell.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Enjoy the show? You can listen to our weekly members-only Pixelated Pro bonus episode by <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/pro/\">signing up for 9to5Google Pro</a> for just $5 per month, or about $1 per episode.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Sponsored by Proton Unlimited</strong>: Pixelated listeners can save 30% on an annual subscription to the company’s suite of privacy-friendly services by <a href=\"https://proton.me/9to5google\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">signing up using our link</a>. Thanks to Proton Unlimited for sponsoring the podcast.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls=\"controls\" src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/pix125.mp3\"></audio></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-subscribe\">Subscribe</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLcKP282Ii48tKK_KUt1kq1Ist9FkYR6lO\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube Podcasts</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://pca.st/podcast/ac8e6ce0-06b1-0136-c264-7d73a919276a\" rel