{"title": "The UGREEN HomeAgent is a ‘local-first’ way to make your smart home even smarter", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/13/the-ugreen-homeagent-is-a-local-first-way-to-make-your-smart-home-even-smarter/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/10/ugreen-homeagent-1.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Smart home tech often relies solely on cloud connections and pricey AI subscriptions, but UGREEN is delivering a local-first solution in its new <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4slyoaq\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener sponsored nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">HomeAgent collection</a>, delivering cameras, speakers, and more that bring the bulk of the functionality and processing directly to your home.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/13/the-ugreen-homeagent-is-a-local-first-way-to-make-your-smart-home-even-smarter/#more-732295\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-13T12:23:59+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-14T16:30:38.251314+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
